AI</span>\n<span class=\"aa-tool-chip aa-tool-chip--has-tip\" data-tip=\"AutoGen: ecosystem example. See the dated evidence in the report for operating metrics.\">AutoGen</span>\n<span class=\"aa-tool-chip aa-tool-chip--has-tip\" data-tip=\"Semantic Kernel: ecosystem example. See the dated evidence in the report for operating metrics.\">Semantic Kernel</span>\n<span class=\"aa-tool-chip aa-tool-chip--has-tip\" data-tip=\"Pydantic AI: ecosystem example. See the dated evidence in the report for operating metrics.\">Pydantic AI</span>\n<span class=\"aa-tool-chip aa-tool-chip--funded aa-tool-chip--has-tip\" data-tip=\"Sixtyfour: ecosystem example. See the dated evidence in the report for operating metrics.\">Sixtyfour</span>\n<span class=\"aa-tool-chip aa-tool-chip--funded aa-tool-chip--has-tip\" data-tip=\"&lt;strong&gt;Kapso&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Enterprise agent workflow platform. Helping organizations deploy and manage AI agent pipelines at scale.\">Kapso</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Layer 3: Memory -->\n<div class=\"aa-layer\" data-layer=\"3\" style=\"--layer-color: var(--accent-gold)\">\n<div class=\"aa-layer-bar\">\n<span class=\"aa-layer-num\">3</span>\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"aa-layer-icon\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\">\n<rect height=\"16\" rx=\"2\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" width=\"16\" x=\"4\" y=\"4\"></rect>\n<path d=\"M4 9h16M9 4v16\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path>\n<circle cx=\"15\" cy=\"15\" fill=\"currentColor\" opacity=\"0.5\" r=\"2\"></circle>\n</svg>\n<span class=\"aa-layer-name\">Memory Layer</span>\n<span class=\"aa-layer-tagline\">State beyond the prompt window</span>\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"aa-layer-chevron\" fill=\"none\" height=\"20\" viewbox=\"0 0 20 20\" width=\"20\">\n<path d=\"M6 8l4 4 4-4\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path>\n</svg>\n</div>\n<div class=\"aa-layer-deta